WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.420
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.620 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.920 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

01:52.210 --> 01:53.340
Fin...

01:54.920 --> 01:59.340
<i>What?! You'll be back in a week, right? Cheer up!</i>

01:59.340 --> 02:00.220
<i>But...</i>

02:10.150 --> 02:13.400
<i>Hey, Fin. Become a great Full-Angel!</i>

02:15.190 --> 02:17.650
<i>Maron, wait for me.</i>

02:19.490 --> 02:23.580
<i>Fin, please come back...</i>

02:24.870 --> 02:26.000
Fin...

02:57.400 --> 03:00.150
A boring world, boring creatures...

03:00.150 --> 03:05.870
If it weren't for the Devil's orders, I'd never come to a place like this. How disgusting!

03:05.870 --> 03:08.200
It's "finish the job and come back to the Demon World," right?

03:08.200 --> 03:11.580
Since she can't transform into Jeanne anymore, how hard can it be?

03:11.580 --> 03:13.630
<i>If </i>we can get rid of her.

03:13.630 --> 03:15.550
What? You don't have any confidence, Noin?

03:16.630 --> 03:21.720
You can linger all you want. I'll take the girl's life.

03:22.840 --> 03:24.100
Myst.

03:24.100 --> 03:25.300
What?

03:25.300 --> 03:26.680
Be careful.

03:26.680 --> 03:28.560
She may not be able to transform...

03:28.560 --> 03:31.940
...but don't underestimate the strength of God's protection of Jeanne.

03:38.360 --> 03:42.860
Demons' Advent! Time of New Transformation!

03:45.950 --> 03:48.950
Hey! Where should we go next Sunday?

03:48.950 --> 03:53.750
Let's check out new CDs, get lunch, shop for clothes...

03:53.750 --> 03:55.920
The new styles for fall should be out!

03:55.920 --> 03:57.460
Oh, we need to look out for bags, too!

03:57.460 --> 04:00.880
Geez! What should we do, Miyako?!

04:00.880 --> 04:02.630
You're acting kinda weird, Maron.

04:02.630 --> 04:04.760
You're excessively hyper.

04:04.760 --> 04:06.890
Why are you so happy?

04:06.890 --> 04:09.100
That's because Jeanne--

04:09.100 --> 04:11.520
Jeanne...what?

04:11.520 --> 04:16.520
<i>I can't tell Miyako that I don't have to be Jeanne anymore!</i>

04:16.520 --> 04:17.190
<i>Fin!</i>

04:22.740 --> 04:24.410
Bubbles!

04:25.780 --> 04:26.990
Fin...

04:26.990 --> 04:28.780
Maron!

04:28.780 --> 04:32.790
Finish what you were trying to say! What about Jeanne?!

04:32.790 --> 04:36.210
J-Jump for joy!

04:36.210 --> 04:41.170
Whatever. Aren't you worried that Chiaki was absent from school because of a cold?

04:41.170 --> 04:42.220
Well...

04:42.220 --> 04:45.550
Besides, I'm busy tomorrow, so I won't be able to hang out with you.

04:45.550 --> 04:46.970
What?! No way!

04:49.640 --> 04:52.560
I'm sorry. Are you all right?

04:52.560 --> 04:54.190
What are you doing, you idiot?!

04:54.190 --> 04:55.390
I-Idiot?

04:55.390 --> 04:57.190
Maron, are you all right?

04:57.190 --> 04:58.560
Hey, little guy.

04:58.560 --> 05:00.690
You're both at fault for bumping into each other...

05:00.690 --> 05:04.150
So instead of "What are you doing," it should be "I'm sorry."

05:04.150 --> 05:05.570
Shut up, hag!

05:05.570 --> 05:07.740
H-Hag...

05:08.990 --> 05:10.030
Takeru!

05:10.790 --> 05:12.790
What did you say?! Apologize to her!

05:12.790 --> 05:15.250
Shut up! I hate you, Mom!

05:15.250 --> 05:16.370
Takeru!

05:24.840 --> 05:27.970
He's good. I choose him.

05:31.430 --> 05:33.520
I'm so very sorry.

05:33.520 --> 05:36.890
Oh, it's all right. I'm fine.

05:37.690 --> 05:40.110
I'll be sure to punish him.

06:04.170 --> 06:08.550
Dad, I'm going to protect this conservatory.

06:08.550 --> 06:09.680
Dad...

06:14.430 --> 06:16.020
This looks like fun.

06:29.860 --> 06:32.620
I'm not going anywhere.

06:32.620 --> 06:35.450
<i>I heard those words.</i>

06:45.590 --> 06:48.050
What a great morning!

06:48.050 --> 06:51.260
I'm going to do whatever I want today!

06:51.260 --> 06:53.300
The Demons are gone...

06:53.300 --> 06:55.350
Loudmouth Fin is gone...

06:57.180 --> 06:59.270
All that's left to do now is...

06:59.270 --> 07:02.810
...wait for Fin to come back!

07:07.990 --> 07:09.740
It's not even noon yet.

07:10.700 --> 07:12.700
I'm kinda bored.

07:15.740 --> 07:18.580
I wonder how that stupid Angel is doing?

07:27.210 --> 07:32.010
<i>To Chiaki: Hurry up and get over that cold! I vouch for its taste!</i>

07:33.220 --> 07:35.600
Why didn't you say "hi?"

07:36.510 --> 07:38.680
It would be troublesome if she found out I was hurt.

07:39.430 --> 07:42.230
Sinbad, you showoff.

07:42.230 --> 07:45.770
Let's eat Maron's lunch. Or are you full?

07:45.770 --> 07:48.690
A-Am I full?!

07:48.690 --> 07:51.570
I'm filled with regret!

07:51.570 --> 07:55.370
I just let Fin go! I can't handle it!

07:56.780 --> 08:00.620
The past is in the past. Let's think about the future.

08:00.620 --> 08:03.540
Hmph! That's easy for you to say!

08:03.540 --> 08:06.880
Think about what's going to happen once Fin comes back!

08:22.690 --> 08:25.310
Um, you dropped this.

08:29.230 --> 08:31.070
You're that person...

08:31.070 --> 08:33.490
Takeru-kun disappeared?

08:33.490 --> 08:38.700
I think he's reluctant to leave this city, where his deceased father's conservatory is located.

08:38.700 --> 08:42.040
The conservatory that was shut down a month ago?

08:42.040 --> 08:49.710
Yes. I didn't want to close it down either, but I had to do it for the both of us.

08:49.710 --> 08:51.300
I see...

08:51.300 --> 08:55.090
I'm sorry I unloaded all my complaints on a stranger.

08:55.090 --> 08:59.220
Um, could you give me a call when you find Takeru-kun?

08:59.220 --> 09:03.310
Um, well... I won't mind how late you call...

09:03.310 --> 09:05.810
I'm just worried about Takeru-kun.

09:08.560 --> 09:10.270
Thank you very much.

09:19.240 --> 09:20.870
Excuse my intrusion!

09:22.910 --> 09:24.750
Takeru-kun?

09:24.750 --> 09:27.750
Takeru-kun, are you here?

09:35.220 --> 09:36.430
Dad...

09:40.300 --> 09:42.260
Takeru-kun! Wake up!

09:46.390 --> 09:47.770
Mom?

09:51.860 --> 09:53.360
What are you...!

09:53.360 --> 09:56.820
Your mom's worried about you. Let's go home.

09:56.820 --> 09:58.780
No! I'm staying here!

10:01.120 --> 10:03.490
Because it's your father's conservatory?

10:03.490 --> 10:05.910
Is that why you can't leave?

10:05.910 --> 10:10.840
Dad would be sad if Mom forgot about him and I left him too.

10:10.840 --> 10:11.960
That's not true.

10:11.960 --> 10:13.170
It is!

10:13.170 --> 10:17.550
I can't just abandon this place and leave Dad all alone!

10:18.300 --> 10:20.640
Your father isn't all alone.

10:22.180 --> 10:23.310
That's because...

10:24.310 --> 10:26.810
...your father is right here.

10:27.690 --> 10:31.610
Right? Besides, what about your mother?

10:31.610 --> 10:34.280
Are you going to leave your mother all alone?

10:35.150 --> 10:36.780
Mom...

10:36.780 --> 10:41.820
Let's go home. Let's go and tell your mother exactly how you feel.

10:41.820 --> 10:44.490
Let's see how your mother feels, too.

10:44.490 --> 10:45.160
Okay.

10:46.950 --> 10:49.500
<i>That boy isn't going anywhere!</i>

10:50.620 --> 10:54.130
<i>He promised not to go anywhere!</i>

10:54.130 --> 10:55.550
Could it be?!

10:59.430 --> 11:00.590
A Demon!

11:01.840 --> 11:03.180
Takeru-kun!

11:03.180 --> 11:06.310
<i>That boy is mine!</i>

11:13.860 --> 11:15.400
<i>Why is there a Demon?!</i>

11:15.400 --> 11:16.780
<i>Why?!</i>

11:37.500 --> 11:38.880
I'm safe?

11:38.880 --> 11:40.880
<i>Oh well...</i>

11:49.520 --> 11:52.850
Now what are you going to do, Jeanne?

11:52.850 --> 11:55.560
Takeru-kun! Takeru-kun!

11:58.820 --> 11:59.860
Onee-chan...

11:59.860 --> 12:04.280
Takeru-kun, please promise me that you won't go near here anymore!

12:04.280 --> 12:06.950
For your sake and your mother's!

12:09.750 --> 12:10.960
Why?!

12:10.960 --> 12:14.880
This is a bad place! So don't come near here!

12:14.880 --> 12:17.920
There's no way my Dad's conservatory could be a bad place!

12:17.920 --> 12:19.760
Stop making up stuff, you idiot!

12:21.050 --> 12:22.630
Takeru-kun, wait!

12:33.390 --> 12:35.270
Takeru-kun...

12:35.270 --> 12:38.940
Fin! Fin! Answer me!

12:38.940 --> 12:41.280
It won't connect...

12:41.280 --> 12:45.320
You said all the Demons were gone! Why...?!

12:45.320 --> 12:48.530
<i>Be careful of Sinbad and Access.</i>

12:50.660 --> 12:54.330
So this is what you meant by "Be careful..."

12:57.500 --> 13:00.250
Takeru-kun hasn't returned yet?!

13:00.250 --> 13:05.180
You promised you wouldn't go anywhere, right Dad?

13:05.180 --> 13:06.760
<i>Yes.</i>

13:06.760 --> 13:09.010
<i>It's a promise...</i>

13:09.010 --> 13:11.060
Oh, it's nothing.

13:11.060 --> 13:13.390
I just thought maybe...

13:13.390 --> 13:14.940
Well, then...

13:18.150 --> 13:20.520
He must have returned to the conservatory.

13:20.520 --> 13:23.610
However, I can't transform into Jeanne anymore...

13:25.320 --> 13:26.610
What should I do?

13:34.750 --> 13:38.210
Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.<i></i>

13:40.340 --> 13:42.380
Strong and serious...

13:42.380 --> 13:44.300
Matchless and marvelous...

13:44.300 --> 13:45.920
Energetic and courageous!

13:48.890 --> 13:50.390
I knew it...

13:51.470 --> 13:52.220
Even so...!

13:54.430 --> 13:55.270
I have to go!

14:13.410 --> 14:14.620
Who is it?!

14:16.540 --> 14:18.870
I'm going to kill Jeanne.

14:25.010 --> 14:27.550
What is it, Sinbad? You're noisy.

14:27.550 --> 14:28.930
Maron's in danger!

14:30.180 --> 14:32.470
I need your help!

14:32.470 --> 14:36.640
W-Wait a minute! You're in no condition to move!

14:36.640 --> 14:37.770
It doesn't matter!

14:37.770 --> 14:39.690
Why?!

14:39.690 --> 14:40.940
I'm protecting Maron.

14:40.940 --> 14:43.020
Why are you forcing yourself?!

14:43.020 --> 14:46.440
Fin is gone! Nothing can be done!

14:46.440 --> 14:52.160
So are you just going to lie around, and wait until Fin comes back?

14:52.160 --> 14:52.990
Well...

14:52.990 --> 14:57.200
It's not over yet. If there's something that I can do...

14:57.200 --> 14:58.580
...then that's all I need.

14:58.580 --> 14:59.670
Sinbad...

15:00.870 --> 15:03.290
Let's do it, Access Time!

15:03.960 --> 15:05.880
Damn!

15:05.880 --> 15:10.090
I guess our manhood would be at stake if we delay, right Sinbad?

15:10.090 --> 15:13.300
I'm going to do what I can, too!

15:35.780 --> 15:37.700
Where's Takeru-kun?!

15:37.700 --> 15:39.330
Give Takeru-kun back!

15:39.330 --> 15:42.880
<i>If you want him back, then save him yourself.</i>

15:44.380 --> 15:45.590
Takeru-kun!

15:46.800 --> 15:48.590
Dad...

15:48.590 --> 15:51.590
Are you all right?! I'm going to save you!

15:51.590 --> 15:54.640
Let the show begin.

16:01.770 --> 16:03.940
It's different from the other Demons!

16:03.940 --> 16:05.610
<i>Exactly!</i>

16:19.790 --> 16:23.120
<i>What's the matter, Jeanne? Finished already?</i>

16:23.120 --> 16:26.340
<i>You're stronger than that!</i>

16:32.880 --> 16:38.390
<i>Show me your true feelings! That's what I want!</i>

16:38.390 --> 16:42.060
Strong...Feelings...

16:42.600 --> 16:47.610
<i>Is this all that the reincarnation of Jeanne d'Arc can do?</i>

16:47.610 --> 16:51.940
<i>Maron isn't strong... Maron is weak...</i>

16:51.940 --> 16:56.910
<i>I want to move but I can't. I can't muster up any strength!</i>

16:56.910 --> 17:00.200
<i>Why is Maron so weak?!</i>

17:00.200 --> 17:02.200
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

17:02.200 --> 17:07.460
What?! Come on, you've got to put up more of a fight! You're boring me.

17:07.460 --> 17:10.500
Enough, then. Just kill her.

17:10.500 --> 17:11.170
<i>Die!</i>

17:15.590 --> 17:18.760
Kaitou Sinbad has arrived!

17:18.760 --> 17:21.310
I will protect Maron.

17:21.310 --> 17:23.850
<i>Let go of me if you don't want to die.</i>

17:23.850 --> 17:26.140
I can't do something pathetic like that.

17:26.140 --> 17:29.110
<i>Then, die!</i>

17:32.190 --> 17:33.740
Maron...

17:36.450 --> 17:41.080
<i>As the reincarnation of Jeanne d'Arc, you're the only one who can do it, Maron!</i>

17:41.080 --> 17:44.120
I'm the only one who can do it...

17:44.120 --> 17:46.250
<i>Now, die!</i>

17:46.250 --> 17:48.290
I want to become stronger...

17:49.000 --> 17:52.300
God is always looking after you.

17:53.340 --> 17:55.550
I want to become stronger!

17:56.720 --> 17:59.760
<i>What?! What is the meaning of this?!</i>

17:59.760 --> 18:05.430
I want power... I want power to protect Maron...!

18:07.940 --> 18:10.440
What's going on?!

18:10.440 --> 18:12.440
The pieces are glowing!

18:22.530 --> 18:23.870
What just happened?!

18:26.750 --> 18:27.870
The feather is...!

18:31.670 --> 18:33.090
Rosary...!

18:36.050 --> 18:38.720
Now, Maron! Transform!

18:39.430 --> 18:41.470
<i>Fin, lend me your power!</i>

18:41.470 --> 18:43.640
<i>Deliver my wish to Jeanne d'Arc!</i>

19:05.490 --> 19:07.540
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

19:07.540 --> 19:09.790
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

19:09.790 --> 19:11.920
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

19:18.050 --> 19:22.300
<i>Kaitou Jeanne has arrived by the order of God!</i>

19:24.350 --> 19:26.430
Impossible! How?!

19:26.430 --> 19:30.560
<i>Good! Now you are worthy for me to defeat!</i>

19:30.560 --> 19:32.730
In the name of God...

19:32.730 --> 19:36.110
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

19:36.110 --> 19:37.940
I seal you here!

19:37.940 --> 19:38.940
<i>Checkmate!</i>

19:45.530 --> 19:46.790
I can't <i>Checkmate!</i>

19:46.790 --> 19:50.660
<i>I've told you that I'm different from those other underling Demons!</i>

19:50.660 --> 19:51.460
<i>Die!</i>

19:59.130 --> 20:00.510
Could it be?!

20:04.890 --> 20:06.050
In the name of God...

20:08.390 --> 20:10.560
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:14.400 --> 20:16.060
I seal you here!

20:26.370 --> 20:27.620
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:34.620 --> 20:36.170
<i>Collection completed!</i>

20:41.170 --> 20:43.180
Looks like I'll be able to enjoy myself a little...

20:44.470 --> 20:46.470
What great strength!

20:46.470 --> 20:51.600
Fin, thank you. I'll do my best until you come back.

20:57.900 --> 21:00.150
I held back a little too much.

21:00.150 --> 21:02.940
I guess it means that you can't underestimate God's power.

21:02.940 --> 21:05.860
Hmph. How is it going for you?

21:05.860 --> 21:08.370
I'll be doing things my own way.

21:08.370 --> 21:10.080
I'll be looking forward to it.

21:15.750 --> 21:18.000
Takeru! Takeru!

21:18.000 --> 21:19.960
Wake up, Takeru!

21:23.090 --> 21:24.340
Mom...

21:24.340 --> 21:28.600
I'm so glad! I've been worried about you! Are you hurt anywhere?

21:28.600 --> 21:29.890
Huh?

21:29.890 --> 21:30.720
What's the matter?

21:31.810 --> 21:33.390
Nothing.

21:33.390 --> 21:34.600
Mom.

21:34.600 --> 21:36.270
What?

21:36.270 --> 21:37.350
I'm sorry.

21:38.690 --> 21:40.480
Good morning!

21:41.400 --> 21:44.820
It's all your fault, Maron! Every single morning...!

21:44.820 --> 21:46.860
What?! I've never asked you to wake me up...

21:46.860 --> 21:48.200
Chiaki!

21:48.780 --> 21:50.030
Yo!

21:50.030 --> 21:51.330
Are you all right?

21:51.330 --> 21:54.160
Yep. Sorry for worried you.

21:54.160 --> 21:56.160
Maron, thanks for lunch.

21:56.160 --> 21:58.250
Oh, sure...

21:58.250 --> 22:00.880
Phew! Man, I'm hot!

22:01.500 --> 22:04.510
Take your seats.

22:04.510 --> 22:09.140
I'm going to introduce a student teacher that has come to our school.

22:11.640 --> 22:15.890
Shikaido Hijiri-sensei will be administrating History.

22:18.270 --> 22:20.020
<i>Our eyes met.</i>

22:21.400 --> 22:22.570
Pleased to meet you.

22:28.610 --> 22:35.250
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.000 --> 22:44.670
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.260 --> 22:49.130
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.130 --> 22:52.850
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.050 --> 23:01.980
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.520 --> 23:05.690
Never forgetting...

23:05.980 --> 23:09.820
...there is unending love.

23:10.530 --> 23:14.580
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.780 --> 23:17.870
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.160 --> 23:21.080
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.540 --> 23:26.050
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.250 --> 23:30.130
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.340 --> 23:37.890
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:47.780 --> 23:49.650
Hey Fin, come here, come here!

23:49.650 --> 23:57.160
Our new History teacher, Shikaidou-sensei, met Dad in France and brought me a letter from him!

23:57.160 --> 23:58.290
Isn't that amazing?

23:58.290 --> 24:04.960
Fin... Geez, are you listening? Oh right... Fin, please hurry back!

24:04.960 --> 24:09.050
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Absolutely Gorgeous! A Mysterious Teacher Appears!

24:09.050 --> 24:14.390
Shikaidou Hijiri here. Pleased to meet you all.
